  (descr "Compatible with Cherry MX, Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) and Choc V2 (PG1353) mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile), User.3=13.95mm square (Kailh Choc V2), User.4=13.80mm square (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 2.25u (courtyard 42.81x19.00mm). For plate-mount stabilizers (no PCB holes needed).")
